.git
.gitignore
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.svelte-kit
**/*.tsbuildinfo
swarmdeck_ros/build
swarmdeck_ros/install
swarmdeck_ros/log
# A host CMake build tree copied into the image carries a CMakeCache.txt full
# of host-absolute paths, and the in-image configure then refuses:
#   "The current CMakeCache.txt directory ... is different than the directory
#    /home/<user>/... where CMakeCache.txt was created"
# It is also pure weight in the build context.
argos/build
sessions/*
!sessions/.gitkeep
docs
*.md
!README.md
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
*.swp
.env
.env.local
*.local.yaml
apple-touch-icon.png
favicon.ico
logo.png
